  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Lee Su had everything taken from her by her husband, Taegang, who committed adultery with her stepmother—and was then murdered by him.\nWhen she opens her eyes, it's her wedding day, seven years ago.\n\nIn this life, I will never be victimized again.\n\nBefore Lee Su, who has resolved to take revenge, appears a man—Moon Jung-hyuk.\n\"Once my ex-boyfriend role is over, let's get married. The term is six months.\"\n\nThrough a contract born of mutual need, Lee Su begins to succeed in her revenge plans against her husband and stepmother, one by one.\n\nMeanwhile, Moon Jung-hyuk, who promised cooperation in exchange for a contract marriage, cannot hide the look in his eyes—fixed only on her.\n\nAnd before she knows it, Lee Su's heart, once consumed entirely by revenge, slowly begins to melt…\n\n_Source: Naver Series, translated_\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851667), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14246965)",
